  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:4fec2",
   "off": 327362,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "マイヨールが小舟の前で\r待っていた\u0010\b",
   "en": "Maillol was waiting by his little boat.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:4fee9",
   "off": 327401,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "マイヨール\r",
   "en": "Maillol\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:4fef6",
   "off": 327414,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「きなすったな\r  よし！出発じゃ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"There ye are, eh? Right, off we go, then!\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:4ff25",
   "off": 327461,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "マイヨールは夜になるのを\r待って小舟を出した\u0010",
   "en": "Maillol waited for nightfall, then pushed off in the little boat.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:4ff56",
   "off": 327510,
   "op": "23",
   "group": "location",
   "jp": "東の監視塔外観",
   "en": "East Watchtower Exterior",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:4ff6e",
   "off": 327534,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "監視塔は闇に包まれて\r静まり返っている\u0010\bフィン達は マイヨールに\r舟を任せると塔の中に入って\rいった\u0010",
   "en": "The watchtower lay wrapped in darkness and silence.\u0010\bLeaving the boat in Maillol's hands, Finn and the others went into the tower.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:4ffe6",
   "off": 327654,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "マイヨールは夜になるのを\r待って小舟を出した\u0010",
   "en": "Maillol waited for nightfall, then pushed off in the little boat.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:50017",
   "off": 327703,
   "op": "23",
   "group": "location",
   "jp": "南の監視塔外観",
   "en": "South Watchtower Exterior",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:5002f",
   "off": 327727,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "監視塔の屋上には明々と\r松明が点されている\u0010\b忍び込むのは難しそうだ\u0010",
   "en": "Torches blaze brightly on the watchtower's roof.\u0010\bSneaking in won't be easy.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:50087",
   "off": 327815,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "マイヨールは夜になるのを\r待って小舟を出した\u0010",
   "en": "Maillol waited for nightfall, then pushed off in the little boat.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:500b8",
   "off": 327864,
   "op": "23",
   "group": "location",
   "jp": "アモーク要塞外観",
   "en": "Fort Amok Exterior",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:500cc",
   "off": 327884,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "マイヨール\r",
   "en": "Maillol\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:500d9",
   "off": 327897,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「正面から行っても\r  入れてはくれまい\u0010\b  要塞に続く階段があった\r  はずじゃが…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Walk up to the front, and they'll not let ye in.\u0010\bThere ought to be a stairway up to the fortress, mind ye...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:50136",
   "off": 327990,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "マイヨール\r",
   "en": "Maillol\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES13:50143",
   "off": 328003,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「すっかり 明るくなって\r  しまったわい\u0010\b  舟が必要なら いつでも\r  きなさい」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Well now, it's gone and got light on us.\u0010\bIf ye need the boat, come by any time.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
